  ],
  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You say that you've been missing me",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Every single time we're not together (Time we're not together)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And I know that I've been gone from everything",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "But I needed that",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Say you wish that you were kissing me",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "It comes out of nowhere, whenever (It comes out of nowhere, whenever)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "But I'm kinda sick and tired, you're so selfish",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Say that I'm not coming back to you",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "But wait, don't leave",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Hate that it's so easy for you",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Wait, I can't see",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Try to walk away",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I keep fallin' for the bad ones (Bad ones)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "The always-make-me-sad ones (Sad ones)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Tryin' hard to hold my ground",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "But it always ties me down",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Yeah, the bad ones",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Way too good at fallin' for the bad ones",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "post-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "(Bad ones, the bad ones)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "(For the bad ones, bad ones)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You're really good at tricking me",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Makin' me believe I'm not enough",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And I'm always so confident",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "'Til you come and trip me up",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Why you so caught up with fixing me?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "You know that's something that I really hate",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "You're the only thing about me that should change",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "You're my one mistake, mm",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
